# Claude Code Preferences for Song Project

## Communication Style
- Do NOT use emojis or icons in any output (code, comments, documentation, commit messages)
- Use plain text markers instead: [DONE], [TODO], [WIP], [WARNING], etc.
- Keep communication professional and concise
- Use markdown formatting but without emoji decorations

## Code Style
- Modern C++20
- 2-space indentation
- snake_case for variables and functions
- Follow existing code patterns
- Document public APIs thoroughly
- No emojis in comments or documentation

## Commit Messages
- Follow conventional commits format
- No emojis or icons
- Clear, descriptive, factual
- Include Co-Authored-By when appropriate
